---
// src/layouts/ArticleLayout.astro
// 这里可以写一点服务器端的 JS，比如接收外面传进来的标题
const { title, tag, date, mainHeading } = Astro.props;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{title} - 扶光日语</title> <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/article.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any" href="/favicon-tab.svg">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="fuguang-navbar">
        <div class="nav-left"></div>
        <div class="nav-center">
            <a href="/" class="circle-logo" title="返回首页"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="扶光日语 Logo"></a>
            <div class="navbar-topic-group" id="navbar-topic-group">
                <a href="/" class="navbar-topic-logo" title="返回首页"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="扶光日语 Logo"></a>
                <a class="topic-link" id="navbar-topic-link" href="#top" title="返回文章顶部">
                    <span id="navbar-topic-text">{mainHeading}</span> </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-right"><a href="#" class="login-btn">登录</a></div>
    </nav>

    <main id="top" class="home-main" style="padding-top: 100px; padding-bottom: 120px;">
        <div class="breadcrumbs">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span class="separator"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" style="font-size: 10px;"></i></span>
            <a href="#">文章</a>
            <span class="separator"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" style="font-size: 10px;"></i></span>
            <span>{mainHeading}</span>
        </div>

        <article class="fuguang-article">
            <header class="article-header">
                <div class="article-meta">
                    <span class="tag">{tag}</span>
                    <span class="date">{date}</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="article-title">{mainHeading}</h1>
            </header>

            <section class="article-content">
                <slot />
            </section>
        </article>
        
        <aside class="fuguang-toc">
            <div class="toc-track">
                <div class="track-line"></div>
                <div class="track-thumb" id="toc-thumb"></div>
                <div class="toc-last-read-marker" id="toc-last-read" style="display: none;">
                    <div class="last-read-line"></div> <button class="last-read-btn Bento-style-btn" id="toc-back-btn">返回</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="toc-info">
                <div class="toc-progress" id="toc-progress">0%</div>
                <div class="toc-current-title" id="toc-title">开始阅读</div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </main>

    <nav class="fuguang-bottom-nav">
        <ul class="bottom-nav-list">
            <li class="nav-item">
                <button class="nav-btn">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
                    <span>菜单</span>
                </button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <button class="nav-btn">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-search"></i>
                    <span>搜索</span>
                </button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <button class="nav-btn">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-heart"></i>
                        <span class="badge">15</span>
                    </div>
                    <span>喜欢</span>
                </button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <button class="nav-btn">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-star"></i>
                        <span class="badge">3</span>
                    </div>
                    <span>收藏</span>
                </button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <a href="#" class="nav-btn">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
                    <span>账号</span>
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const article = document.querySelector('.fuguang-article');
            const articleTitleEl = document.querySelector('.article-title');
            const navbarEl = document.querySelector('.fuguang-navbar');
            const navbarRight = document.querySelector('.fuguang-navbar .nav-right');
            const navbarLogo = document.querySelector('.nav-center .circle-logo');
            const navbarTopicGroup = document.getElementById('navbar-topic-group');
            const navbarTopicLink = document.getElementById('navbar-topic-link');
            const navbarTopicText = document.getElementById('navbar-topic-text');
            const toc = document.querySelector('.fuguang-toc');
            const track = toc?.querySelector('.toc-track');
            const thumb = document.getElementById('toc-thumb');
            const info = toc?.querySelector('.toc-info');
            const progressText = document.getElementById('toc-progress');
            const titleText = document.getElementById('toc-title');
            const lastReadMarker = document.getElementById('toc-last-read');
            const backBtn = document.getElementById('toc-back-btn');

            function syncNavbarTopicTypography() {
                if (!articleTitleEl || !navbarTopicLink) return;
                const titleStyles = window.getComputedStyle(articleTitleEl);
                navbarTopicLink.style.fontSize = titleStyles.fontSize;
                navbarTopicLink.style.fontWeight = titleStyles.fontWeight;
                navbarTopicLink.style.lineHeight = titleStyles.lineHeight;
                navbarTopicLink.style.letterSpacing = titleStyles.letterSpacing;
            }

            function syncNavbarTopicPosition() {
                if (!articleTitleEl || !navbarTopicGroup || !navbarTopicLink || !navbarEl || !navbarRight) return;

                const titleRect = articleTitleEl.getBoundingClientRect();
                const navRect = navbarEl.getBoundingClientRect();
                const navRightRect = navbarRight.getBoundingClientRect();

                const groupLeft = Math.max(16, titleRect.left);
                const groupTop = navRect.top + navRect.height / 2;
                navbarTopicGroup.style.left = `${groupLeft}px`;
                navbarTopicGroup.style.top = `${groupTop}px`;

                const logoAndGap = 42;
                const maxTitleWidth = Math.max(120, navRightRect.left - 24 - groupLeft - logoAndGap);
                navbarTopicLink.style.maxWidth = `${maxTitleWidth}px`;
            }

            function updateNavbarReadingIndicator() {
                if (!articleTitleEl || !navbarLogo || !navbarTopicGroup) return;

                const triggerOffset = 70;
                const titleRect = articleTitleEl.getBoundingClientRect();
                const shouldShowTopic = titleRect.bottom <= triggerOffset;

                navbarTopicGroup.classList.toggle('is-visible', shouldShowTopic);
                navbarLogo.classList.toggle('is-hidden', shouldShowTopic);
            }

            if (articleTitleEl && navbarTopicText) {
                navbarTopicText.textContent = articleTitleEl.textContent?.trim() || '当前文章';
            }
            syncNavbarTopicTypography();
            syncNavbarTopicPosition();
            updateNavbarReadingIndicator();

            window.addEventListener('scroll', updateNavbarReadingIndicator, { passive: true });
            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
                syncNavbarTopicTypography();
                syncNavbarTopicPosition();
                updateNavbarReadingIndicator();
            });

            if (!article || !toc || !track || !thumb || !info || !progressText || !titleText) return;
            if (getComputedStyle(toc).display === 'none') return;

            const articleContent = article.querySelector('.article-content');
            if (!articleContent) return;
            const headers = Array.from(articleContent.querySelectorAll('h2, h3'));
            const STORAGE_KEY = `fuguang_last_read_${window.location.pathname}`;

            const clamp = (value, min, max) => Math.min(max, Math.max(min, value));

            function getScrollMetrics() {
                const scrollTop = window.scrollY || document.documentElement.scrollTop || 0;
                const scrollHeight = Math.max(0, document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight);
                return { scrollTop, scrollHeight };
            }

            function getTrackMetrics() {
                const trackHeight = track.clientHeight;
                const thumbHeight = thumb.offsetHeight;
                const maxThumbTop = Math.max(0, trackHeight - thumbHeight);
                return { trackHeight, thumbHeight, maxThumbTop };
            }

            function setInfoTopByThumbTop(thumbTop) {
                const { trackHeight } = getTrackMetrics();
                const infoHeight = info.offsetHeight || 0;
                const maxInfoTop = Math.max(0, trackHeight - infoHeight);
                const infoTop = clamp(thumbTop, 0, maxInfoTop);
                info.style.top = `${infoTop}px`;
            }

            function setThumbAndInfoByRatio(ratio) {
                const { maxThumbTop } = getTrackMetrics();
                const thumbTop = clamp(ratio, 0, 1) * maxThumbTop;
                thumb.style.top = `${thumbTop}px`;
                setInfoTopByThumbTop(thumbTop);
            }

            let markerTargetScrollTop = 0;
            function hideLastReadMarker() {
                if (!lastReadMarker) return;
                lastReadMarker.style.opacity = '0';
                lastReadMarker.style.display = 'none';
            }

            function showLastReadMarker(targetScrollTop) {
                if (!lastReadMarker) return;
                const { scrollHeight } = getScrollMetrics();
                if (scrollHeight <= 0) return;

                const { trackHeight } = getTrackMetrics();
                const markerRatio = clamp(targetScrollTop / scrollHeight, 0, 1);
                const markerTop = markerRatio * trackHeight;
                lastReadMarker.style.top = `${markerTop}px`;
                lastReadMarker.style.display = 'flex';
                lastReadMarker.style.opacity = '1';
            }

            function initLastReadModule() {
                if (!backBtn) return;
                hideLastReadMarker();

                backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    if (markerTargetScrollTop <= 0) return;
                    window.scrollTo({ top: markerTargetScrollTop, behavior: 'smooth' });
                    hideLastReadMarker();
                });
            }

            let isDragging = false;
            let lastScrollTop = window.scrollY || document.documentElement.scrollTop || 0;
            let hasScrolledDown = false;
            let scrollDirection = 'idle';
            const savedInitialTop = Number(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY));
            let downPhasePeakTop = Number.isFinite(savedInitialTop) ? Math.max(savedInitialTop, lastScrollTop) : lastScrollTop;

            function updateScrollspy() {
                if (isDragging) return;

                const { scrollTop, scrollHeight } = getScrollMetrics();
                if (scrollHeight <= 0) return;

                const progressRatio = clamp(scrollTop / scrollHeight, 0, 1);
                const progressPercent = Math.round(progressRatio * 100);
                progressText.innerText = `${progressPercent}%`;

                setThumbAndInfoByRatio(progressRatio);

                const detectionThreshold = 150;
                let currentSection = '开始阅读';
                for (let i = headers.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                    if (headers[i].getBoundingClientRect().top < detectionThreshold) {
                        currentSection = headers[i].innerText.trim();
                        break;
                    }
                }
                titleText.innerText = currentSection;

                const directionDelta = scrollTop - lastScrollTop;
                if (directionDelta > 2) {
                    hasScrolledDown = true;
                    if (scrollDirection !== 'down') {
                        downPhasePeakTop = scrollTop;
                    } else {
                        downPhasePeakTop = Math.max(downPhasePeakTop, scrollTop);
                    }
                    markerTargetScrollTop = downPhasePeakTop;
                    hideLastReadMarker();
                    scrollDirection = 'down';
                } else if (directionDelta < -2) {
                    if (scrollDirection !== 'up' && hasScrolledDown) {
                        markerTargetScrollTop = Math.max(downPhasePeakTop, lastScrollTop);
                    }
                    const shouldShowBack = hasScrolledDown && (markerTargetScrollTop - scrollTop > 80);
                    if (shouldShowBack) {
                        showLastReadMarker(markerTargetScrollTop);
                    }
                    scrollDirection = 'up';
                }
                lastScrollTop = scrollTop;

                if (scrollTop > 20) {
                    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, String(Math.round(scrollTop)));
                }
            }

            let dragOffsetY = 0;
            let currentDragRatio = 0;

            function getClientY(event) {
                if (event.touches && event.touches.length) return event.touches[0].clientY;
                if (event.changedTouches && event.changedTouches.length) return event.changedTouches[0].clientY;
                return event.clientY;
            }

            function startDrag(event) {
                event.preventDefault();
                const thumbRect = thumb.getBoundingClientRect();
                const clientY = getClientY(event);
                dragOffsetY = clientY - thumbRect.top;

                isDragging = true;
                thumb.classList.add('is-dragging');
            }

            function moveDrag(event) {
                if (!isDragging) return;
                event.preventDefault();

                const clientY = getClientY(event);
                const trackRect = track.getBoundingClientRect();
                const { maxThumbTop } = getTrackMetrics();

                const thumbTop = clamp(clientY - trackRect.top - dragOffsetY, 0, maxThumbTop);
                currentDragRatio = maxThumbTop > 0 ? thumbTop / maxThumbTop : 0;

                thumb.style.top = `${thumbTop}px`;
                setInfoTopByThumbTop(thumbTop);
                progressText.innerText = `${Math.round(currentDragRatio * 100)}%`;
            }

            function endDrag() {
                if (!isDragging) return;
                isDragging = false;
                thumb.classList.remove('is-dragging');

                const { scrollHeight } = getScrollMetrics();
                const targetTop = clamp(currentDragRatio, 0, 1) * scrollHeight;
                window.scrollTo({ top: targetTop, behavior: 'smooth' });
            }

            thumb.addEventListener('mousedown', startDrag);
            window.addEventListener('mousemove', moveDrag);
            window.addEventListener('mouseup', endDrag);
            thumb.addEventListener('touchstart', startDrag, { passive: false });
            window.addEventListener('touchmove', moveDrag, { passive: false });
            window.addEventListener('touchend', endDrag);
            window.addEventListener('touchcancel', endDrag);

            initLastReadModule();
            updateScrollspy();
            window.addEventListener('scroll', updateScrollspy, { passive: true });

            let resizeTimer = null;
            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
                clearTimeout(resizeTimer);
                resizeTimer = setTimeout(() => {
                    updateScrollspy();
                    if (lastReadMarker && lastReadMarker.style.display !== 'none' && markerTargetScrollTop > 0) {
                        showLastReadMarker(markerTargetScrollTop);
                    }
                }, 200);
            });

            window.addEventListener('pagehide', () => {
                const currentTop = window.scrollY || document.documentElement.scrollTop || 0;
                if (currentTop > 20) {
                    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, String(Math.round(currentTop)));
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>